  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Satyanarayan Mohapatra @ Satya vs State Of Odisha .... Opp. Party on 5 December, 2022 Author: Chittaranjan Dash Bench: Chittaranjan Dash In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 13844 of 2022 Satyanarayan Mohapatra @ Satya .... Petitioner Narayan Mohapatra Mr. Rajendra Narayan Rout, Advocate -versus- State of Odisha .... Opp. Party Mr. M. K. Mohanty, Asc. Coram: Justice Chittaranjan Dash Order Order No. 05.12.2022 03.",
    "facts": "This is an application for bail U/s.438 Cr.P.C. filed by the Petitioner in apprehension of arrest for his alleged involvement in the offences under Sections 272, 273, 420, 482, 483 & 488/34 of IPC, Section 52, 53 of Orissa Excise Act and Section 51, 52, 53, 57, 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned Counsel for the State in the meanwhile obtained the up- to-date Case Diary and chemical examination report which clearly indicates that the Exts. marked as 'B' is not fit for human consumption as the sample is raw alcohol. He further submitted that the record reveals the present Petitioner is a habitual offender of the similar offences.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned Counsel for the State in the meanwhile obtained the up- to-date Case Diary and chemical examination report which clearly indicates that the Exts. marked as 'B' is not fit for human consumption as the sample is raw alcohol. He further submitted that the record reveals the present Petitioner is a habitual offender of the similar offences.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
